<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps upgrades Consumer Portfolio.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps upgrades Consumer Portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Wednesday it had upgraded the $20 million of rising interest subordinated redeemable securities of Consumer Portfolio Services Inc to Single B Plus from Single B.</p>
<p>It said the change reflected the company's good profitability and consistent asset quality performance in a difficult competitive environment.</p>
<p>Consumer Portfolio buys, sells and services retail automobile installment sale contracts originated by new-car franchise dealers.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
